depends login
send 1
a create inbox/case
receive 1
a OK done
send 1
b create inbox/CASE
receive 1
b NO [ALREADYEXISTS] /users/script/inbox/CASE already exists
send 1
c create inbox/CASE/case
receive 1
c OK done
send 1
